title: Wandering Scholar
portrait left: seeker
portrait right: scholar

scholar: Haven't seen another person in a while! Need some help?
scholar: I can upgrade a card, patch you up, or loan you some gold.

choice:
  - Upgrade a card -> upgrade
  - Heal 15 -> heal
  - Take 40 gold -> gold

@upgrade
  > card upgrade choose 1
  scholar: Not my best work, but far from my worst...
  > end

@heal
  > hp 15
  scholar: A finely applied bandage, I should think.
  > end

@gold
  > gold 40
  scholar: I'll expect that back next time we meet!
  > end
